## 5. Collapse Thresholds

We define 𝒞 zones:

| Range | Zone | Interpretation |
|-------|------|----------------|
| 0–1.5 | Static | Symbol underloaded or ritualized |
| 1.5–3.0 | Stable | Shared, resilient meaning |
| 3.0–6.0 | Stressed | Misunderstandings emerge |
| 6.0–9.0 | Fractured | Shared reality begins to erode |
| 9.0–15.0 | Collapsing | Symbol breaks down |
| 15+ | Saturated | Meaning fails, system disintegrates |

The number **42** appears repeatedly across overloaded systems (AI hallucination, metaphysical frameworks, overloaded abstractions) and may represent a symbolic saturation ceiling—what we call the **Meaning Event Horizon**.

